{"1376960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead World", "steam_appid": 1376960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3920500], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a first-person shooter set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes place 30 years after World War III.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miguel has to go to Rosario, Santa Fe Province to see what happened to a shipment that was supposed to arrive. During the trip, he gets trapped in the city dominated by &quot;Las Serpientes&quot; a group that controls the only bridge between Rosario and Entre Rios, his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Explore detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Cool Rogue,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Mode:</strong> Face off against another player in 1v1 mode and prove you're the toughest in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and discover if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is currently 66% complete and will be updated and updated with new content over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a project made with love and a lot of hard work. If you like what you see, your support helps me continue creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely, Juani from <strong>Milanesa Studio</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a first-person shooter set in a post-apocalyptic Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes place 30 years after World War III.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/0e32a624a30fc87e0b51fde357c83868.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miguel has to go to Rosario, Santa Fe Province to see what happened to a shipment that was supposed to arrive. During the trip, he gets trapped in the city dominated by &quot;Las Serpientes&quot; a group that controls the only bridge between Rosario and Entre Rios, his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/4bc136bfbed526fb9dbe27ae2fe9014c.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Explore detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Cool Rogue,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Mode:</strong> Face off against another player in 1v1 mode and prove you're the toughest in the dead world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Dead World and discover if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.poster.avif?t=1784086790\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.webm?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/cbd30e2154253e39c40b6ccd9e1a5865.mp4?t=1784086790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is currently 66% complete and will be updated and updated with new content over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World is a project made with love and a lot of hard work. If you like what you see, your support helps me continue creating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sincerely, Juani from <strong>Milanesa Studio</strong></p>", "short_description": "Dead World is a first-person shooter game set in a post-apocalyptic world, where you follow Miguel's journey to return home to a war-torn Argentina.", "supported_languages": "Spanish -